    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch rockets into orbit around planets, find a good trajectory, and take risks to increase your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to launch your rocket from the portal. Once in the air, it will rotate thanks to the planets' gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best trajectory to stay in orbit for as long as possible, getting close to the three planets without crashing to score the most points within the allotted time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo, multiplayer, and even on Twitch directly with your viewers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more to come!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch rockets into orbit around planets, find a good trajectory, and take risks to increase your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to launch your rocket from the portal. Once in the air, it will rotate thanks to the planets' gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best trajectory to stay in orbit for as long as possible, getting close to the three planets without crashing to score the most points within the allotted time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo, multiplayer, and even on Twitch directly with your viewers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more to come!</p>",
